Ever since my last installation of nethack got accidentally wiped out,
I have been trying quite hard to ascend as a knight without much
success... The best I did was to choke on a mind flayer corpse in Orcus
town. Ahem...

So this time Oliver the gallant knight set out determinedly. At DL5, he
wandered into a quality apparels and accessories store full of wands.
And he picked up a jeweled wand and the shopkeeper said that it would
be 500 zorkmids. Oliver dropped it because he had no way to cough up
that kind of money - but he went out, gathered the cash, bought it -
and as he tried to engrave something on the floor he was asked if he
would like to make a wish!

DL5, xplev 3. Oliver got two scrolls of charging, a SDSM, a cloak of
MR, the helm of brilliance, speed boots, frost brand, and gauntlets of
dexterity. Nothing else could beat him...

And soon, he learnt how to cast magic missile. And he slayed Ixoth to
find Merlin's precious mirror...

Oliver entered Moloch's sanctum with 350 hit points and 480 spell
points and at an xplev of 30. He was invincible. Or he thought he was.

By the time he reached the plane of Earth with the the AoY, he had
missiled Rodney 6 times.

The elemental planes passed by like small skirmishes, as Oliver
prepared himself for the final battle on the Astral Plane where he
would meet Death, Pestilence and Famine. And then...

